flowchart TD
    start([Start]) --> memory[optional profile memory\nread-only / non-evidentiary]
    memory --> router[router suggests a draft direction]
    router --> ground[read-only evidence and market context]
    ground --> write[write one draft]
    write --> observe[advisory observations\nclaims + voice + confidentiality]
    observe --> critique[optional computed commentary]
    critique --> review{{user sees draft and observations}}
    review -->|feedback or fresh angle| write
    review -->|direct edit or source record| observe
    review -->|save| commit[save review artifact\ndrafts/queue]
    review -->|end| end([End])
    commit --> end
